{"thread":{"threadID":3850,"boardID":117,"topic":"Team News - 12.10.2016","time":1476309038,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1476467843,"lastPoster":"CyberTroniX","replies":16,"views":735,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":8},"tags":[{"tagID":23,"name":"news"},{"tagID":47,"name":"team"}],"posts":[{"postID":50809,"threadID":3850,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Team News - 12.10.2016","time":1476309038,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":8,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","time":1476309261,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1476309372,"value":1},{"userID":2287,"username":"Krokoblack","time":1476309404,"value":1},{"userID":2198,"username":"Raven","time":1476310882,"value":1},{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476335286,"value":1},{"userID":2104,"username":"EndoX.","time":1476345024,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1476345163,"value":1},{"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","time":1476426565,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>CyberTroniX hat seine Test-Admin</strong><strong></strong><strong> </strong><strong>bestanden</strong><strong></strong><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p>Ab heute ist <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1749-cybertronix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@CyberTroniX</a> erneut ein vollständiger Administrator.<br>Sein Umgang mit Usern auf dem Server und im TeamSpeak ist hervorragend, es hat in seiner Test-Zeit keine einzige Beschwerde gegen ihn gegeben. Auch die Aktivität auf den Gameservern, im TeamSpeak und im Forum spricht für sich.<br>Es gibt absolut nichts, was gegen seinen Uprank spricht.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Definitiv verdient, weiter so!<br></p></div><p><br><strong>ApudoX hat ebenfalls seine </strong><strong>Test-Admin </strong><strong>bestanden</strong><strong></strong><strong></strong><br>Ebenso ist <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> nun ein vollwertiges Mitglied des Adminteams. Obwohl während seiner Testzeit ein paar kleinere Kritiken an ihm aufkamen, konnte alles gut gelöst werden. Diese waren nicht schlimm, Fehler können und sollen passieren, aus sowas lernt man. Wichtig ist nur, dass diese Fehler nicht enorm gravierend und schädlich für die Server + Community sind.<br>Seine Aktivität ist phänomenal, über 200 Stunden auf den Gameservern, immer auf dem TeamSpeak vorzufinden und auch sehr präsent im Forum  durch reguläre Beiträge oder Ideen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Glückwunsch ApudoX! Denke bitte an die von mir angesprochenen Punkte.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Raven has completed his </strong><strong>Test-Admin</strong><strong> time</strong><br><strong></strong>The last uprank of the day goes to <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2198-raven/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Raven</a>. He had a good start but took a major plunge after his smurf account was used by his friend and was subsequently banned by us. That friend then registered on the forum, only to insult the admins. It was proven, that his account was used by his friend, therefore he could stay in the team, although with a major warning. Therefore, it took him exactly 100 days (more than 3 months) to get his uprank. Apart from that, there were no issues or complaints at all.<br>Activity on the gameservers is good enough, TeamSpeak and forum should improve but they&#x27;re fine considering the language barrier.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>All in all, good job, keep going. Just don&#x27;t repeat your mistakes.<br>Congratulations.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50810,"threadID":3850,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1476309358,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476335270,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339242,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Herzlichen Glühstrumpf Boys.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Habt es euch zwar nicht verdient, aber ich bin trotzdem stolz auf euch <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50811,"threadID":3850,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1476309538,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1476309618,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339245,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Oh man Jungs, wirklich schade das zu hören aber naja was soll man machen ne, eventuell klappt es ja beim nächsten Mal! Toi, toi, toi!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50812,"threadID":3850,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1476310962,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476335295,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339247,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>GZ an alle</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50814,"threadID":3850,"userID":2198,"username":"Raven","subject":"","time":1476311121,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476335298,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339253,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Awesome, thanks for the awesome time I have had so far on the server and I hope that there is still many months if not years to come and look forward to. I just would like all to note that I haven&#x27;t been able to talk on the servers nor the TeamSpeak due to an issue with my microphone. Currently the dongle/amp for my headset is broken and I do not have a splitter to use for the time being. I am looking to purchase a replacement part shortly however for now I will be unable to verbally communicate across any servers.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Congratulations to <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1749-cybertronix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@CyberTroniX</a> and <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> also!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks again and I look forward to whatever may come in future with Dream! <span class=\"missing-media\">[thanksforit*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50816,"threadID":3850,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1476316812,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339259,"value":1},{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476335305,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wie, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> hat die Testzeit bestanden?!<br>Dazu enhalte ich mich.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50817,"threadID":3850,"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","subject":"","time":1476333259,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339264,"value":1},{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476335308,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bin auch etwas verwirrt darüber, dass er die Testzeit bestanden hat.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50818,"threadID":3850,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1476335200,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476339269,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vielen Dank für die Glückwünsche!<br>Freut mich erneut im Team zu sein.<br>Herzlichen Glückwunsch/Congratulations <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2198-raven/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Raven</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[dream-explode*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50819,"threadID":3850,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1476339324,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476357705,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vielen Dank an alle und natürlich Glückwünsche an Cyber und Raven !</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50821,"threadID":3850,"userID":2339,"username":"Simon.","subject":"","time":1476342510,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Glückwunsch  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">👍</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50822,"threadID":3850,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1476346128,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476346330,"value":1},{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1476357713,"value":1},{"userID":2339,"username":"Simon.","time":1476359063,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Congratulation guys on your deserved rank up to a fully-fleged admin this is well deserved <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50825,"threadID":3850,"userID":1888,"username":"Kenny","subject":"","time":1476369547,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumula